      "created_at": "2026-03-17T07:17:40.370Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sangosteve\">@sangosteve</a></p>\n<p>Role Permission Manager for purchase order doctype needs to be defined for administrator role where he has to have submit access so that Approve button can set PO as submitted (docstatus = 1).</p>",
